        rdfs:label "Drosophila ficusphila longitudinal sex-comb Turing wavelength at 2.1 µm — Morphological realism / specimen match: 84/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Last-frame CV similarity to the gallery plate is 81.9 at 800×600 with 16 frames. The pass-2 figure places the plate, the focal spiral and the flat control on one row. Mask measurements now quantify how the plate and the frame differ (coherency 0.8279 vs 0.9494). The plate is still a stylized gallery asset, which caps this score below a micrograph match." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/drosophila_ficusphila_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md L27–L29: plate is stylized, not an SEM <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0c76d15d/datasets/drosophila_ficusphila_turing_wavelength_s0/README.md#L27-L29>" ;
